# Files and directories excluded from the public-facing repo by /anu-publish.
# These are internal coordination artifacts that don't belong in the public release.

# Internal MIGRATION generators are excluded, but the public correspondence
# table (the old AS/ES -> new XS crosswalk + prefix scheme) IS shipped so
# consumers who referenced legacy IDs can map them. Exclude everything in
# MIGRATION/ except crosswalk.csv and PREFIX_SCHEME.md.
MIGRATION/_*.py
MIGRATION/*.pyc
MIGRATION/MIGRATE_SCHEME_LOG.md
MIGRATION/divergences_from_ST2.md
MIGRATION/migrate_xs_*.py
MIGRATION/__pycache__/

# Stage coordinator patches - internal session work-in-progress artifacts.
_stage*_patches/

# Internal one-shot build/HDARP-integration helper scripts (underscore-prefixed,
# not part of the public replication pipeline; they hardcode workstation paths
# and reference the internal HDARP_Extractions tree). The reproducible pipeline
# is the L00/L01/P02/V03/O06 numbered scripts, which run from the bundle.
code/_*.py

# Registry backup snapshots - retained in Technical/ for rollback only.
series_registry.pre_*.json
series_registry.json.backup_*

# Internal coordination docs - useful in development but reference internal paths.
# Replicators get the methodology PDF and per-series DPRs instead.
docs/ROADMAP.md
docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md

# Pipeline state files - regenerated by run.py, don't commit to public release.
PIPELINE_STATE.json
ANU_LEDGER.json
PROVENANCE_INDEX.json
VALIDATION_REPORT.json
SUBSOURCE_METADATA.json

# Secrets - never publish.
.env
*.env
!api_keys.env.template
data/user-inputs/api_keys.env

# Workspace process cruft - definitive-package principle: ship only code + data
# + concise scientific docs. Handoffs, remediation/outstanding-step plans,
# build narratives, surveys, blockers, and internal publish/signing procedures
# are coordination artifacts, not scientific content.
Handoffs/
GITHUB_RELEASE_GUIDE.md
VERIFY_SIGNATURE.md
STEP_LOG.jsonl
BUILD_NARRATIVE.md
BACKLOG.md
*_REMEDIATION_PLAN.md
*_OUTSTANDING_STEPS_PLAN.md
*_SURVEY_*.md

# Stale Stage-2 adequacy report - dated 2026-05-23, predates the v1.2 Ch7
# proxy retirement and now states proxy:true / gate_passed:false, which
# contradicts the published registry (proxy:false). Excluded to avoid
# shipping a doc that falsely describes the release.
Docs/chapters/CH7_ADEQUACY_REPORT.json

# Internal QA review reports (per-wave / per-chapter anu-review process
# artifacts). These describe the build/scrub process and contain coordination
# notes (e.g. GitHub-push task lists), not scientific replication content.
Docs/chapters/*_REVIEW_REPORT.json
